  <!-- ============================================================ BAND 3: 3 FLAGSHIP INTERACTIVE TEXTBOOKS -->
  <section class="band" id="textbooks">
    <div class="band-head">
      <div>
        <div class="band-kicker">Ground-Up Interactive Treatises</div>
        <h2>Three complete books with 18 live browser labs</h2>
        <p class="band-desc">Every chapter builds from first principles and lets you manipulate live proofs, interaction nets, compressors, attention kernels, pocket pruners, and PoUW clearinghouses directly in the page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-grid">
      <a class="flag-card" href="/learn">
        <div class="flag-top">
          <span class="flag-badge">01 · FOUNDATION</span>
          <span class="flag-stats">7 chapters · 12 live labs</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Computation from First Principles</h3>
        <p>Start from zero. Derive parallel interaction nets, leaderless confluence, §4.5 face-guarded pruning, proof-carrying relations, and content-addressed truth without a single black box.</p>
        <div class="flag-tags">
          <span>Interaction Nets</span><span>Cubical Paths</span><span>§4.5 Pruning</span><span>Content Store</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flag-foot"><span>Open /learn</span><span>→</span></div>
      </a>

      <a class="flag-card" href="/hyperfactor">
        <div class="flag-top">
          <span class="flag-badge blue">02 · NATIVE ENGINE</span>
          <span class="flag-stats">8 chapters · 7 live labs</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Universal Hyperfactoring</h3>
        <p>How &lt;50-line verified modules emit a single 667 KB zero-UB ARM64 super-CLI (<code>hx</code>): exact rANS compression, 1-pass FlashAttention, zero-tape AD, 16.78M pocket pruning, verified C++20 finance, Calma GDSII v6.0, and 15 KB <code>HyperOS</code>.</p>
        <div class="flag-tags">
          <span>hxz</span><span>hx-tensor</span><span>hx-fold</span><span>hx-book</span><span>hx-tapeout</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flag-foot"><span>Open /hyperfactor</span><span>→</span></div>
      </a>

      <a class="flag-card" href="/decentralized">
        <div class="flag-top">
          <span class="flag-badge">03 · ECONOMY &amp; WEB</span>
          <span class="flag-stats">8 chapters · 7 live labs</span>
